# ops: decode
# spec: a Bitlist without limit still has a bit count that fits 32 bits (8 * (len - 1) + position < 2^32)
# fault: the unbounded Bitlist decoder drops the 2^29-byte guard (bit count may wrap)
# why: no limit means no check
# file: src/obj.bend
